ta\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"debtCap\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"TakeTooHighDebt\",\"type\":\"error\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"blend\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"contract IBlend\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"claims\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"debt\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"rate\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"ts\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"active\",\"type\":\"bool\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"funded\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"mint\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"payable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"outstanding\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint8\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"uint8\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"owner\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"pool\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"contract IPool\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"lienId\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"minProfit\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"sweep\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"lienId\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"components\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"lender\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"borrower\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"collection\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"tokenId\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"amount\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"startTime\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"rate\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"auctionStartBlock\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"auctionDuration\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"internalType\":\"struct Lien\",\"name\":\"lien\",\"type\":\"tuple\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"rate\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"debtCap\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"take\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"withdrawing\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"stateMutability\":\"payable\",\"type\":\"receive\"}],\"devdoc\":{\"kind\":\"dev\",\"methods\":{},\"version\":1},\"userdoc\":{\"kind\":\"user\",\"methods\":{\"mint()\":{\"notice\":\"Fork-only repayment simulation: the real venue pays accrued debt as Pool units (Blend's transferFrom from the borrower) without touching the funded float; on the fork a repayment is any native this contract mints without counting it as funded. Never used by the bot live.\"},\"sweep(uint256,uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"After a measured Repay/Refinance on our taken lien: debt plus accrued interest came back to this contract as Pool units, so the Pool balance is at least the funded float again; the excess is the realized interest profit, withdrawn from the pool as native and sent to the bot wallet in the same transaction.\"},\"take(uint256,(address,address,address,uint256,uint256,uint256,uint256,uint256,uint256),uint256,uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"Take an open refinance auction: pays the full current debt in Pool units, becomes the lien lender. debtCap must equal the reconstructed current debt (amount + accrued) - a bigger on-chain payment reverts the take (TakeTooHighDebt), so a wrong reconstruction can never overpay.\"}},\"notice\":\"Executor for the Blur Blend Dutch refinance-auction taker bot (lead 148). The bot's float is held in the Blur Pool token (0x0000000000A39bb272e79075ade125fd351887ac): receive() mints the native it receives 1:1 into Pool units. take() pays the current debt of an open Dutch auction lien (Blend pulls Pool units from this contract with transferFrom - no allowance, no approval) and becomes the lien lender at a rate we choose (over the Dutch ceiling reverts RateTooHigh inside Blend; a stale lien tuple reverts InvalidLien; a closed auction reverts AuctionIsNotActive). sweep() sends the Pool balance above the funded float (the accrued interest after the lien met its next liquidity event - measured Repay/Refinance transfers arrive from the borrower to this contract) to the bot wallet as native in one transaction. Worst case per transaction is gas only; every unexpected state reverts the whole call.\",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"src/BlurRefiTaker.sol\":\"BlurRefiTaker\"},\"evmVersion\":\"london\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\"},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":true,\"runs\":200},\"remappings\":[]},\"sources\":{\"src/BlurRefiTaker.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0x9db5376b5ccacef9a055f09452fe376ed2b6f1d9644e0a1a1d0a8a8f31af45fa\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://4b54dc53e6fad65eba9c636899bb46d3bc9395b31c47e072eca4f95087eaa305\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmWJV8eXh8Z5pgwTyseo8g1p64UHDuUsuB6sFivq6KeDGi\"]}},\"version\":1}","metadata":{"compiler":{"version":"0.8.17+commit.8df45f5f"},"language":"Solidity","output":{"abi":[{"inputs":[{"internalType":"address","name":"pool_","type":"address"},{"internalType":"address","name":"blend_","type":"address"}],"stateMutability":"nonpayab